Package: apiworkbench
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, libgtk-3-0, libglib2.0-0
Description: Cross-platform API client for building and testing HTTP requests
 ApiWorkbench is a fast, keyboard-friendly API client in the spirit of
 Postman. It provides request tabs, a full request builder (all HTTP
 methods, query params, headers, JSON/XML/form/GraphQL bodies), auth
 helpers, environments with {{variables}}, collections, request history,
 response assertions, and a collection runner with recurring interval
 runs for endpoint monitoring.
 .
 Published by Dhiva-Labs.
